/**\
 * V15.1 "ULTIMATE" Certified Gold Edition\
 * \
 * DESIGN PHILOSOPHY:\
 * 1. Physical Model Control: Translating engine thermodynamics into digital logic.\
 * 2. 2oo2 Architecture: Parallel computation paths for safety-critical voting.\
 * 3. Deterministic Execution: Constant execution time per cycle (No dynamic allocation).\
 * 4. Billon-Kilometer Durability: 64-bit cycle tracking and Kalman anti-windup.\
